OL,3,GNEWSAStates to consider economic
OL,4,Aimpacts of proposals
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery proposition brought before the
OL,7,FStates Assembly will have to include a
OL,8,Fstatement outlining its potential
OL,9,Feconomic impact, under government
OL,10,Fplans.
OL,12,FDuring a scrutiny hearing, Economic
OL,13,FDevelopment Minister Gerald Voisin said
OL,14,Fhis fellow ministers were "aligned"
OL,15,Fwith the idea.
OL,17,FVoisin stressed the "importance of good
OL,18,Feconomic advice" before taking
OL,19,Fdecisions, and told the hearing's panel
OL,20,Fthat work was already under way to
OL,21,Fformally propose the change.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
